{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/nawayef-west-by-modon-properties-al-hudayriat-island","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1125,"crm_id":"1561","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Nawayef West by Modon","slug":"nawayef-west-by-modon-properties-al-hudayriat-island","display_address":"Al Hudayriat Island","building_type":["apartment","mansions"],"completion_year":"TBA","developer":"Modon Properties","price":null,"display_price":"","lattitude":24.4164419,"longitude":54.3639426,"min_bedrooms":3,"max_bedrooms":8,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Nawayef West is a residential community on Al Hudayriat Island in Abu Dhabi, developed by Modon Properties. The community consists of three distinct areas: Nawayef West Homes, Nawayef West Mansions, and Nawayef Heights. Each offers stunning views of the azure waters surrounding the island and the skyline of Abu Dhabi. Residences within the community come in various layouts ranging from<strong> 3-8 bedrooms</strong>. Luxury mansions are available in various configurations, each featuring spacious rooms with floor-to-ceiling windows offering scenic vistas. According to the masterplan, most villas come equipped with a fully-equipped gym, staff room, private garage, outdoor balcony or terrace, and private pool. These spacious apartments provide abundant living space, ample natural light, and a sense of opulence. The homeowners of Al Hudayriat Island have easy access to pristine beaches and expansive parks. Located on the hills of the island, overlooking the bustling marina or the serene waters of the Hudayriat Canal, these residential areas are designed for those seeking an enviable island lifestyle at the heart of the capital. The residential complex offers a variety of outdoor activities and convenient proximity to key areas of the city. Nawayef West boasts easy access to the city center thanks to its well-developed road network, offering a peaceful but dynamic lifestyle among Abu Dhabi's most desirable developments.</p><p>Current availability on request.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1561/images/2024/06/05/yR9hjSwVPhNznt0VhlTxi3vflEoa9Uh7PO7kr7gg.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/05/yR9hjSwVPhNznt0VhlTxi3vflEoa9Uh7PO7kr7gg.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1561/images/2024/06/05/ivs625bQUul5Z9ruGIcbyyT3Mnloaz9gvgvkkXTf.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/05/ivs625bQUul5Z9ruGIcbyyT3Mnloaz9gvgvkkXTf.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1561/images/2024/06/05/OGCV9sFSjuvT9ORoeETjs1Okx9ibGYlMOrAeKJYx.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/05/OGCV9sFSjuvT9ORoeETjs1Okx9ibGYlMOrAeKJYx.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1561/images/2024/06/05/3lmCcVSZX4aWotqAmIgUVWfKA9eQjkdliFtxdlvc.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/05/3lmCcVSZX4aWotqAmIgUVWfKA9eQjkdliFtxdlvc.jpg","__ggfxIndex":3}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2264,"url":"","file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Brochure_0f5250c39a.pdf","hash":"Brochure_0f5250c39a","name":"Brochure"},"item":[],"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","hash":"General_Brochure_90d7160d65","name":"General"}},"video_module":{"id":1502,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[],"payment_plan_text":"TBA","payment_plans":[],"community":"","publish":1,"currency":"","amenities":[],"bitrix":{"id":543,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Nawayef West by Modon","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Nawayef West by Modon"